  <CENTER><H1>Patch Message</H1></CENTER>
<H2>February 24th, 3:00 pm</H2>
<BR>
<BR>
** Legends Character Move Reminder **<BR>
<BR>
With twelve hours until character moves begin, there's still time to complete account signups!<BR>
<BR>
People who have completed the web signup and character move request, and have confirmed their reservation after logging in, before tomorrow's 3:00 am (PST) patch will still be in time to move to Stormhammer, which will go live immediately following the downtime.<BR>
<BR>
If you're looking to sign up for EverQuest Legends, would like to read the Frequently Asked Questions about the new service, or need information on the character move policy, please visit http://legends.everquest.com<BR>
<BR>
(IMPORTANT: Before beginning a new signup today, please make sure that the EMail address in your account information is up to date - That is where your confirmation code will be sent.  Without that code, you will not be able to select characters to move to Stormhammer.)<BR>
<BR>
- The EverQuest Legends Team<BR>
